WEBVTT

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:41.708
What?!

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:47.505
Concede defeat. The Connections
for Rigsario and Schneivalle

00:00:47.505 --> 00:00:49.257
are in our possession.

00:00:49.257 --> 00:00:50.884
"Connections"?

00:00:53.136 --> 00:00:55.513
He means their electronic spirits.

00:00:55.513 --> 00:00:56.973
You...

00:00:56.973 --> 00:00:58.308
Hurry up and go.

00:00:58.308 --> 00:01:02.395
That little girl is the only one who
can keep Mr. Goat inside you in check.

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:08.401
That woman...

00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:12.947
Please, hold on.

00:01:12.947 --> 00:01:15.283
The machinery department
is just a little farther.

00:01:15.283 --> 00:01:16.868
Take those stairs up ahead.

00:01:16.868 --> 00:01:18.495
All right!

00:01:27.003 --> 00:01:30.006
<i>Brave your truth and brave yourself</i>

00:01:30.006 --> 00:01:33.551
<i>So we can go somewhere with the dite</i>

00:01:33.551 --> 00:01:41.267
<i>Keep hope alive, now we</i>
<i>wanna find the new world</i>

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:46.856
<i>Roaming around the city having lost my map</i>

00:01:46.856 --> 00:01:50.193
<i>Even a dying world</i>

00:01:50.193 --> 00:01:56.991
<i>Let me hear a life deep</i>
<i>within that won't stop running</i>

00:01:56.991 --> 00:02:00.120
<i>I seared the undying light into my eyes</i>

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:03.540
<i>Refusing to shut them</i>
<i>even when they dried</i>

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:10.338
<i>I don't believe anything I can</i>
<i>obtain without getting hurt</i>

00:02:10.338 --> 00:02:16.428
<i>A single emotion</i>
<i>directed toward someone</i>

00:02:16.428 --> 00:02:23.685
<i>Splits the steel darkness</i>
<i>like the light of morning</i>

00:02:24.019 --> 00:02:28.398
<i>One day brave your</i>
<i>truth and brave yourself</i>

00:02:28.398 --> 00:02:31.860
<i>So you will drastically change</i>

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:37.949
<i>Compounded strength and prayers</i>

00:02:37.949 --> 00:02:41.619
<i>Intersecting futures</i>
<i>and wishes held close</i>

00:02:41.619 --> 00:02:45.123
<i>I will give these to no one</i>

00:02:45.123 --> 00:02:46.624
<i>Just tough and alive</i>

00:02:46.624 --> 00:02:51.838
<i>It links our hearts</i>

00:03:05.977 --> 00:03:09.939
Now that's somethin' else! A <i>kei-ra </i>cannon?

00:03:09.939 --> 00:03:11.983
Are your preparations complete?

00:03:11.983 --> 00:03:16.821
Yeah. All I need is a photo of my
lover so I can feel sentimental.

00:03:16.821 --> 00:03:18.948
There are just so many of them...

00:03:19.574 --> 00:03:21.076
Just drop dead.

00:03:21.076 --> 00:03:25.163
But if I had one of you,
that single photo would be enough.

00:03:26.122 --> 00:03:28.291
Sure enough, just die!

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:34.255
Oh, well. Guess I'll have to
live a little longer, eh?

00:03:34.798 --> 00:03:38.259
"A Guided Encounter"

00:03:51.481 --> 00:03:53.775
It seems you don't exercise enough.

00:03:53.775 --> 00:03:56.820
Shut up! Whose fault is that?!

00:03:59.155 --> 00:04:02.242
Isn't it about time you
acquiesce and hand it over?

00:04:02.242 --> 00:04:03.159
No!

00:04:03.159 --> 00:04:05.620
Then it can't be helped!

00:04:09.332 --> 00:04:13.128
I don't care for doing things by force, but...

00:04:20.802 --> 00:04:22.637
Be quiet!

00:04:24.931 --> 00:04:26.891
Let's get you another one.

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:31.563
Stop it.

00:04:31.563 --> 00:04:32.897
Be quiet!

00:04:32.897 --> 00:04:35.233
Category 1 Evacuation Alert.

00:04:35.233 --> 00:04:37.694
--Category 1 Evacuation Alert.
--Stop it!

00:04:37.694 --> 00:04:41.156
--Please evacuate to the shelter.
--S-Stop it!

00:04:43.241 --> 00:04:44.784
Are you...?

00:04:44.784 --> 00:04:46.703
You mock me?!

00:05:02.135 --> 00:05:05.096
You mock me, though
you've never fought before?!

00:05:05.096 --> 00:05:07.766
You all would've run away for sure!

00:05:07.766 --> 00:05:09.559
If it was really in front of you,

00:05:09.559 --> 00:05:11.728
you would've run away for sure!

00:05:11.728 --> 00:05:15.690
You're a military artist, yet you ran
away when faced with a contaminoid!

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:17.150
Shut up!

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:22.697
I will change. In Ignacius's
dreams, this mistaken world...

00:05:22.697 --> 00:05:25.116
this world that mocks me, will change!

00:05:25.116 --> 00:05:27.202
I'll make it change!

00:05:27.869 --> 00:05:29.704
How pitiful.

00:05:33.583 --> 00:05:34.626
Nina!

00:05:34.626 --> 00:05:38.171
I gather you were driven from your home city.

00:05:38.171 --> 00:05:40.590
But even here you couldn't
overcome your cowardliness,

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:42.217
and so you chose the easy path.

00:05:42.217 --> 00:05:44.511
Shut up, damn you!

00:05:55.814 --> 00:05:57.232
Nina...

00:05:59.317 --> 00:06:01.319
Saya! Be careful!

00:06:22.924 --> 00:06:24.300
Rigsario?

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:25.802
Oh, I know that!

00:06:25.802 --> 00:06:27.220
Really?

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:29.639
It's quite delicious, isn't it?

00:06:29.639 --> 00:06:31.683
That's Rygzax.

00:06:31.683 --> 00:06:33.935
Huh? Oh, you're right.

00:06:33.935 --> 00:06:37.272
In my hometown of Schneivalle,
the hermit warbler city,

00:06:37.272 --> 00:06:40.567
"Rigsario" is the name of a certain machine:

00:06:40.567 --> 00:06:44.571
The Rigsario Device. I've never seen it,

00:06:44.571 --> 00:06:48.116
but it's a mechanical womb fitted
to Schneivalle's electronic spirit,

00:06:48.116 --> 00:06:51.411
able to give birth to other spirits...

00:06:51.411 --> 00:06:54.122
A machine that is the "mother"
of the electronic spirits.

00:06:54.122 --> 00:06:56.249
Something like that exists?

00:06:56.249 --> 00:06:59.044
So who was after Myath?

00:06:59.044 --> 00:07:04.674
I don't know.
But they used the word "Connection".

00:07:04.674 --> 00:07:09.220
There could be something connecting
the electronic spirits to the Rigsario Device.

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:10.430
And...

00:07:10.805 --> 00:07:14.100
we've unwittingly gotten in the way.

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:16.519
What, you understand?

00:07:16.519 --> 00:07:18.772
Ah! You just insulted me, didn't you?!

00:07:18.772 --> 00:07:21.024
No, I didn't mean...

00:07:21.024 --> 00:07:25.403
I swear... I may not look it, but I've
got good grades in everything but math!

00:07:25.403 --> 00:07:27.280
Huh? But wait.

00:07:29.324 --> 00:07:31.326
Then earlier, why...

00:07:32.577 --> 00:07:34.829
Why did he help me?

00:07:34.829 --> 00:07:39.793
My guess is that he wanted
it all to himself. The achievement.

00:07:39.793 --> 00:07:42.253
What a small man.

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:44.798
Nina?

00:07:46.007 --> 00:07:47.425
Nina!

00:07:53.973 --> 00:07:57.185
Unforgivable! Unforgivable, you bitches!

00:07:57.185 --> 00:07:59.562
I'll friggin' kill you!

00:08:06.569 --> 00:08:08.196
I swear...

00:08:09.572 --> 00:08:13.576
A military artist with a penchant
for running away just won't do.

00:08:17.455 --> 00:08:20.542
Did you ever do this as a child?

00:08:20.542 --> 00:08:24.963
Put your ear to the tracks,
waiting for the train to come from afar.

00:08:28.842 --> 00:08:31.553
That vibration, transmitted through the ear...

00:08:32.387 --> 00:08:35.265
The fear of a death that slowly approaches.

00:08:35.265 --> 00:08:37.392
Cut it out! If something like that came up--

00:08:37.392 --> 00:08:42.522
You'd have to flee. But a little longer...
Just a little longer...

00:08:42.522 --> 00:08:45.442
Even you couldn't go against
something like that scot-free!

00:08:45.442 --> 00:08:47.152
It's... It's...

00:08:47.152 --> 00:08:49.904
Ah, the thrill of a brush with death.

00:08:49.904 --> 00:08:51.781
How irresistible.

00:08:51.781 --> 00:08:53.825
It's a monster!

00:08:59.289 --> 00:09:03.710
A first-term elder. Freshly made, eh?
Not what I was hoping for.

00:09:06.379 --> 00:09:08.631
It certainly is a monster.

00:09:08.631 --> 00:09:12.677
Not a creature in this world
compares to a contaminoid.

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:17.223
It's ferocious, extremely
adaptable to its environment,

00:09:17.223 --> 00:09:19.100
and a prodigious breeder.

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:22.687
Even if we ganged up on it,
I doubt we'd have a chance at winning.

00:09:23.313 --> 00:09:26.191
Help me! Please!

00:09:26.191 --> 00:09:31.237
But what if one attained a power
that dwarfs even the contaminoids...

00:09:31.237 --> 00:09:35.825
if a power that could surpass
anything in this world were close at hand?

00:10:09.234 --> 00:10:12.404
True, there were problems
even with the first generation...

00:10:12.404 --> 00:10:17.242
But to think, such a despicable man
could be of the Lueckens family...

00:10:18.493 --> 00:10:22.330
It seems you've revealed
that you're not of this world.

00:10:22.330 --> 00:10:24.749
And you're different from those
Wolfmask guys from before.

00:10:24.749 --> 00:10:27.502
At least you've got good instincts. Genetics?

00:10:52.027 --> 00:10:54.195
I'm sorry.

00:10:54.195 --> 00:10:55.739
I'm okay.

00:10:55.739 --> 00:10:59.951
No! Myath is all right now. Rest a little.

00:10:59.951 --> 00:11:01.369
But...

00:11:04.956 --> 00:11:07.459
I'm still... weak.

00:11:08.293 --> 00:11:11.504
One of my comrades...
He was hurt and collapsed.

00:11:11.504 --> 00:11:12.672
Oh...

00:11:12.672 --> 00:11:18.970
When that happened, I thought
it was all over. That it was the end.

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:23.058
I can't forgive that weakness in myself.

00:11:23.058 --> 00:11:24.476
Why do...?

00:11:25.226 --> 00:11:27.771
I swear... Hya!

00:11:29.981 --> 00:11:32.400
What are you doing?!

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:34.235
120 points!

00:11:35.945 --> 00:11:39.574
I understand a little... How you feel.

00:11:39.574 --> 00:11:44.204
Since I was a child, I've had
someone who's always helped me, too.

00:11:44.204 --> 00:11:46.414
That's different. I--

00:11:46.414 --> 00:11:51.836
It's the same. Your comrade
and the friend who helped me.

00:11:51.836 --> 00:11:53.963
They worked hard because they
wanted to help people,

00:11:53.963 --> 00:11:55.882
for them to be happy.

00:11:55.882 --> 00:12:00.470
But if I just lament my weakness,
those people are sure to be sad.

00:12:23.618 --> 00:12:25.954
Nina? Nina?!

00:12:32.752 --> 00:12:34.921
What is this?

00:12:34.921 --> 00:12:36.339
Nina!

00:12:36.965 --> 00:12:40.218
You who possess the sentiment
that is my lifesource...

00:12:40.218 --> 00:12:45.974
I desire to become the blade
that sweeps aside Ignacius's filth.

00:12:45.974 --> 00:12:47.809
Desire... Huh?

00:12:49.644 --> 00:12:51.646
An electronic spirit?

00:12:51.646 --> 00:12:53.064
Pray.

00:12:53.565 --> 00:12:54.691
Myath?

00:12:54.691 --> 00:12:59.070
Pray... To the hidden electronic spirit.
The ancestral one.

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:00.280
What do you mean, "pray"?

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:05.910
Soon, its power will not be enough
to restrain the Fallen Ones.

00:13:07.162 --> 00:13:10.623
Pray! If you wish to save that individual.

00:13:10.623 --> 00:13:12.751
Nina...

00:13:12.751 --> 00:13:15.170
Please... Help her.

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:20.175
This person...

00:13:21.551 --> 00:13:24.971
She's important. Very...

00:13:24.971 --> 00:13:26.389
important.

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:47.077
Please.

00:13:52.082 --> 00:13:53.708
Please!

00:13:55.835 --> 00:13:59.089
I will lend... just a little of my power.

00:13:59.089 --> 00:14:00.215
Who are you?

00:14:00.215 --> 00:14:04.969
But forget this for now.
The time has not yet come.

00:14:04.969 --> 00:14:06.388
You're...

00:14:28.993 --> 00:14:30.620
Saya.

00:14:36.876 --> 00:14:38.503
This is...

00:14:40.588 --> 00:14:42.465
She seems fine...

00:14:43.591 --> 00:14:46.386
Huh? I...

00:14:46.386 --> 00:14:48.263
Are you all right?

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:50.348
Yes.

00:14:50.348 --> 00:14:51.391
Where is Nina?

00:14:51.391 --> 00:14:53.018
Nina?

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:06.322
The contaminoids are within firing range!

00:15:10.994 --> 00:15:12.537
Begin the countdown!

00:15:12.537 --> 00:15:14.372
Beginning countdown.

00:15:14.748 --> 00:15:19.294
Five... Four... Three... Two... One...

00:15:19.294 --> 00:15:20.920
Fire!

00:15:34.934 --> 00:15:38.229
That's hot! The heat reaches even this far?

00:15:38.229 --> 00:15:40.190
That's a burn, huh?

00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:41.816
Let's go!

00:15:47.989 --> 00:15:50.533
Why are you simply watching?

00:15:50.533 --> 00:15:52.369
I don't know.

00:15:56.456 --> 00:16:00.377
Is it all right for me to stay here?

00:16:00.377 --> 00:16:02.879
Why do you think they attack

00:16:02.879 --> 00:16:05.298
when they have little chance of winning?

00:16:07.801 --> 00:16:11.680
Because they have pride as military artists.

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:15.558
Not for others, but for themselves.

00:16:15.558 --> 00:16:16.935
Pride...

00:16:16.935 --> 00:16:21.773
Yes. That is why they
will not falter. Unlike you.

00:16:22.982 --> 00:16:24.859
I will not tell you to have pride.

00:16:24.859 --> 00:16:28.738
But leaving the reason
you fight to others is dangerous.

00:16:33.952 --> 00:16:35.787
What is that?!

00:16:41.334 --> 00:16:42.252
Felli!

00:16:42.252 --> 00:16:44.838
An electronic spirit... Zuellni.

00:16:44.838 --> 00:16:47.215
Zuellni? Where?!

00:16:48.008 --> 00:16:50.802
Up? You mean she's outside the city?

00:17:10.905 --> 00:17:13.950
Are you guys mercenaries or something?

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:16.411
Something close to that, I guess.

00:17:16.411 --> 00:17:17.746
They're coming.

00:17:17.746 --> 00:17:19.414
What is this?

00:17:19.414 --> 00:17:23.293
It's like a coming attraction. For this world.

00:17:24.127 --> 00:17:26.171
Haven't you ever thought about it?

00:17:26.171 --> 00:17:30.258
Just how irrational the world we live in is?

00:17:31.384 --> 00:17:34.596
And there are different reasons for that.

00:17:34.596 --> 00:17:39.601
The electronic spirits,
the contaminoids, Rigsario, Ignacius...

00:17:39.601 --> 00:17:39.976
--Zidd!

00:17:39.976 --> 00:17:42.354
--And the Aurora Field.
--Zidd!

00:17:42.354 --> 00:17:45.482
Aurora Particles leak from insulation space

00:17:45.482 --> 00:17:47.525
and cause a change in the natural laws.

00:17:47.525 --> 00:17:51.529
That's why weird things
constantly pop up everywhere.

00:17:52.364 --> 00:17:55.241
So you know everything, do you?

00:17:55.241 --> 00:17:58.495
I guess. But watch your ass.

00:17:59.371 --> 00:18:01.790
Wh-What is this?!

00:18:02.707 --> 00:18:05.669
Don't worry. It won't come out.

00:18:11.341 --> 00:18:15.553
You've gotten a lot better at
using <i>kei</i>, haven't you?

00:18:15.553 --> 00:18:17.806
What do you intend to have me do?

00:18:17.806 --> 00:18:22.102
Don't flatter yourself.
I don't expect anything of you.

00:18:22.102 --> 00:18:26.106
But I <i>am </i>interested in that
Fallen One that's squatting inside you...

00:18:26.106 --> 00:18:29.901
and the girl that was with you.

00:18:29.901 --> 00:18:31.695
You mean Leerin?

00:18:31.695 --> 00:18:36.491
She's got the ancestral electronic
spirit inside her. Protect her.

00:18:36.491 --> 00:18:38.952
Otherwise... live life how you like.

00:18:38.952 --> 00:18:40.495
That's it?

00:18:40.495 --> 00:18:44.124
Kindergarten is a bit early
to learn the art of love, isn't it?

00:19:05.520 --> 00:19:07.355
This is...

00:19:13.611 --> 00:19:16.114
This is... the world.

00:19:20.785 --> 00:19:23.288
Our... world.

00:19:49.439 --> 00:19:51.733
That's <i>my </i>prey!

00:20:06.414 --> 00:20:09.417
There are so many of them.
What are they, roaches?

00:20:09.417 --> 00:20:10.794
Sharnid.

00:20:10.794 --> 00:20:11.920
Felli?

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:13.463
Layfon is coming.

00:20:13.463 --> 00:20:15.465
Lay... Huh?!

00:20:23.973 --> 00:20:25.392
That's...

00:20:26.726 --> 00:20:29.312
Restoration 0-1!

00:20:53.294 --> 00:20:56.339
That's... Zuellni!

00:21:09.144 --> 00:21:10.979
Who is that?

00:21:31.249 --> 00:21:32.667
It can't be!

00:21:32.876 --> 00:21:34.461
Ma'am!

00:21:36.588 --> 00:21:38.214
Layfon...

00:21:38.882 --> 00:21:41.301
Ma'am!

00:21:41.301 --> 00:21:43.345
Layfon!

00:21:43.345 --> 00:21:45.180
Ma'am!

00:21:47.891 --> 00:21:49.517
Layfon...

00:22:04.657 --> 00:22:06.993
Confirmed.

00:22:06.993 --> 00:22:08.953
It is Nina Antalk.

00:22:10.705 --> 00:22:12.123
Nina...

00:22:16.378 --> 00:22:19.297
She brought him back.

00:22:26.262 --> 00:22:36.356
<i>Hello, who are you thinking of?</i>

00:22:36.356 --> 00:22:43.446
<i>This letter still lies within my breast</i>

00:22:43.446 --> 00:22:53.498
<i>That fragment of memories</i>
<i>of you, suddenly encountered,</i>

00:22:53.498 --> 00:23:00.588
<i>has pierced my heart and I can't move</i>

00:23:00.588 --> 00:23:05.427
<i>I want you to notice, don't notice</i>

00:23:05.427 --> 00:23:09.139
<i>Do you treat me coldly because of love?</i>

00:23:09.139 --> 00:23:18.732
<i>I want to tell you "Be by my side," </i>
<i>but I can't say it</i>

00:23:19.524 --> 00:23:28.116
<i>It was in this filthy world</i>
<i>that I was able to meet you</i>

00:23:28.116 --> 00:23:39.294
<i>Please play this miracle</i>
<i>that has descended to my heart</i>

00:23:39.294 --> 00:23:47.302
<i>Zuellni my love</i>

00:23:53.808 --> 00:23:56.895
<i>Nina has returned to Zuellni,</i>
<i>but she is unable to tell</i>

00:23:56.895 --> 00:23:59.981
<i>her comrades in the 17th Platoon</i>
<i>of the Fallen One within her.</i>

00:23:59.981 --> 00:24:02.484
<i>Then, just before the upcoming</i>
<i>battle between Zuellni and Myath,</i>

00:24:02.484 --> 00:24:04.611
<i>Felli is kidnapped.</i>

00:24:04.611 --> 00:24:06.196
<i>Next time, "The Night Before</i>
<i>the Intermunicipal Battle," and...</i>

00:24:06.196 --> 00:24:08.128
<i>Restoration!</i>
